    "media:imagetext": "Who is Your Chef?\nDirecting the preparation of every meal\nserved aboard a United Air Lines Main-\nliner, is an experienced, culinary-wise chef.\nIn charge of United's Omaha Commissary,\nwhich prepares meals for service on Main-\nliners flying the coast-to-coast schedules, is\nClarence Laubhan, for the past two and\none-half years with United Air Lines. Chef\nLaubhan, a native of Colorado and Ameri-\ncan trained, has satisfied gourmets at the\nKiowa Lodge in Bailey, Colorado, in Fred\nHarvey Restaurants, and the Park Lane\nHotel in Denver.\nUNITED AIR LINES\nOMAHA\nSky diner\nCITRUS FRUIT AND CHERRY WINE COCKTAIL\nBaby Spring Lamb in Casserole\nWITH FRESH VEGETABLES\nHOT ROLLS\nCottage Cheese and Tomato Salad\nCHEFS DRESSING\nPecan Cake with Lemon Sance\nOR\nCHEESE AND CRACKERS\nCOFFEE\nTEA\nMINTS\nMILK",
